# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Generated by Tauri
# will have schema files for capabilities auto-completion
/gen/schemas

# Generated by `tauri android init` — regenerated fresh from tauri.conf.json
# (productName/identifier) on demand rather than tracked, so the Android
# project never carries a stale package name/app label baked in from a
# previous rebrand. Was previously (incorrectly) committed — see the Diwan
# rebrand commit that removed it from tracking.
/gen/android

# WebView2 Fixed Version runtime, pinned to 109.0.1518.140 (the last build
# Microsoft ever shipped for Windows 7/8/8.1) so the Windows installer can
# support genuine Win7 machines via `fixedRuntime` in tauri.conf.json.
# NOT committed: it's a large (~250MB) third-party binary with no official
# download source any more (Microsoft's Fixed Version page now only serves
# the current release) — see DEPLOYMENT.md's "Windows 7 support" section for
# where this has to come from and how it's placed here for a build.
/vendor/webview2-fixed-runtime-109/
